# Final Validation

✔ Helm Release: Deployed

✔ DaemonSet: 3/3 Ready

✔ Pods: 3 Running

✔ Terraform Apply: Successful

✔ Platform Services deployment resumed successfully.

---

# Preventive Recommendations

- Monitor node pod density as part of platform health checks.
- Size managed node groups with sufficient pod capacity for platform DaemonSets.
- Consider enabling VPC CNI Prefix Delegation to increase pod density.
- Keep `atomic = false` during platform bring-up to simplify troubleshooting.
- Add DaemonSet scheduling verification to the Platform Services validation checklist.
